e loop stage</data></edge><edge id="E2_S3_depends_on" source="E2" target="S3"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">C2 experiment depends on explain prediction stage</data></edge><edge id="E3_S4_depends_on" source="E3" target="S4"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">C3 experiment depends on hypothesis generation stage</data></edge><edge id="E4_S5_depends_on" source="E4" target="S5"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">C5 experiment depends on curiosity inquiry stage</data></edge><edge id="E5_S6_depends_on" source="E5" target="S6"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">C6 experiment depends on stable belief stage</data></edge><edge id="E6_S7_depends_on" source="E6" target="S7"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">C7 experiment depends on sensorium processing stage</data></edge><edge id="E7_S8_depends_on" source="E7" target="S8"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">C8 experiment depends on merge governance stage</data></edge><edge id="E8_S10_depends_on" source="E8" target="S10"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Sleep experiment depends on sleep cycle stage</data></edge><edge id="E11_S9_depends_on" source="E11" target="S9"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Probationary pipeline depends on Stage 0 probation</data></edge><edge id="E12_S15_depends_on" source="E12" target="S15"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Concept birth depends on ontology integration stage</data></edge><edge id="E13_S8_depends_on" source="E13" target="S8"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Replay sandbox depends on C8 merge governance stage</data></edge><edge id="V1_L4_depends_on" source="V1" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Surprise variable instantiates Shannon surprise law</data></edge><edge id="V2_L5_depends_on" source="V2" target="L5"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Attention weight instantiates precision-weighted attention</data></edge><edge id="V4_L10_depends_on" source="V4" target="L10"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Stability variable instantiates stability curve</data></edge><edge id="V5_L9_depends_on" source="V5" target="L9"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Fracture ratio instantiates fracture mechanics</data></edge><edge id="V8_L7_depends_on" source="V8" target="L7"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Effective learning rate instantiates Inertia Law</data></edge><edge id="V9_L2_depends_on" source="V9" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">H is the first term of the free energy proxy</data></edge><edge id="V10_L2_depends_on" source="V10" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">S is the second term of the free energy proxy</data></edge><edge id="V11_L2_depends_on" source="V11" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">A is the third term of the free energy proxy</data></edge><edge id="V12_L2_depends_on" source="V12" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">E is the weighted sum of H, S, A</data></edge><edge id="M1_L19_depends_on" source="M1" target="L19"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI composite instantiates the CPI formula</data></edge><edge id="M2_V9_depends_on" source="M2" target="V9"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Entropy metric measures variable H</data></edge><edge id="M3_V10_depends_on" source="M3" target="V10"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Surprise metric measures variable S</data></edge><edge id="M4_V11_depends_on" source="M4" target="V11"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Active load metric measures variable A</data></edge><edge id="M5_V12_depends_on" source="M5" target="V12"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Energy metric measures variable E</data></edge><edge id="M10_V5_depends_on" source="M10" target="V5"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Fracture ratio metric measures variable fracture ratio</data></edge><edge id="M11_V20_depends_on" source="M11" target="V20"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Coverage metric measures probation coverage</data></edge><edge id="M14_L16_depends_on" source="M14" target="L16"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Edge confidence depends on Bayesian edge evaluation</data></edge><edge id="S6_L7_depends_on" source="S6" target="L7"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Stable belief depends on Inertia Law</data></edge><edge id="S6_L8_depends_on" source="S6" target="L8"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Stable belief depends on Exception Quarantine</data></edge><edge id="S6_L9_depends_on" source="S6" target="L9"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Stable belief depends on Fracture Mechanics</data></edge><edge id="S11_L1_depends_on" source="S11" target="L1"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Living graph depends on Hebbian learning</data></edge><edge id="R1_L2_depends_on" source="R1" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Risk arises because proxy used as free energy stand-in</data></edge><edge id="R2_A2_depends_on" source="R2" target="A2"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Risk from assumption that flat Markov is sufficient</data></edge><edge id="R3_L7_depends_on" source="R3" target="L7"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Risk that Inertia Law may not generalize</data></edge><edge id="R3_L8_depends_on" source="R3" target="L8"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Risk that quarantine may not generalize</data></edge><edge id="R4_A13_depends_on" source="R4" target="A13"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Risk from metaphorical neuroscience language</data></edge><edge id="R5_A10_depends_on" source="R5" target="A10"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Risk from hand-authored scaffolding assumption</data></edge><edge id="R9_A13_depends_on" source="R9" target="A13"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Risk from overclaiming active inference</data></edge><edge id="K1_M1_depends_on" source="K1" target="M1"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Kill criterion depends on CPI metric</data></edge><edge id="K5_M19_depends_on" source="K5" target="M19"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Kill criterion depends on surprise slope metric</data></edge><edge id="K6_V24_depends_on" source="K6" target="V24"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Kill criterion depends on exhaustion threshold</data></edge><edge id="K7_V5_depends_on" source="K7" target="V5"><data key="edgetype">depends_on</data><data key="edgedesc">Kill criterion depends on fracture ratio variable</data></edge><edge id="L5_L7_contradicts" source="L5" target="L7"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">C6 replaces precision-weighted learning with Inertia Law; attention no longer modulates learning rate</data></edge><edge id="A4_R2_contradicts" source="A4" target="R2"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Single-level surprise contradicts true predictive coding which needs hierarchy</data></edge><edge id="A7_R1_contradicts" source="A7" target="R1"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Claim of adequacy contradicts formal FEP requirements</data></edge><edge id="A2_L3_contradicts" source="A2" target="L3"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Flat Markov contradicts the need for hierarchical structure in real brains</data></edge><edge id="A6_R6_contradicts" source="A6" target="R6"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Local rules sufficient contradicts known STDP mechanisms</data></edge><edge id="A5_R2_contradicts" source="A5" target="R2"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Single-level attention contradicts hierarchical attention models</data></edge><edge id="S6_S2_contradicts" source="S6" target="S2"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">C6 stable beliefs contradict C1 flat probability model; C6 replaces it</data></edge><edge id="L7_L5_contradicts" source="L7" target="L5"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Inertia (inverse-stability scaling) directly contradicts precision-weighting (surprise-amplified learning)</data></edge><edge id="A10_K4_contradicts" source="A10" target="K4"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Hand-authored scaffolding contradicts claim of developmental emergence</data></edge><edge id="S9_S15_contradicts" source="S9" target="S15"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Stage 0 does NOT commit to ontology; contradicts integration claim</data></edge><edge id="L19_K8_contradicts" source="L19" target="K8"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI could show improvement while system not genuinely learning (gaming the metric)</data></edge><edge id="A9_R2_contradicts" source="A9" target="R2"><data key="edgetype">contradicts</data><data key="edgedesc">Flat loop contradicts hierarchical predictive coding claim</data></edge><edge id="E1_S2_validates" source="E1" target="S2"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C1 validates predictive loop works</data></edge><edge id="E2_S3_validates" source="E2" target="S3"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C2 validates explanation generation</data></edge><edge id="E3_S4_validates" source="E3" target="S4"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C3 validates hypothesis generation on surprise</data></edge><edge id="E4_L13_validates" source="E4" target="L13"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C5 validates EIG-driven curiosity works</data></edge><edge id="E5_L7_validates" source="E5" target="L7"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C6 validates Inertia Law prevents catastrophic forgetting</data></edge><edge id="E5_L8_validates" source="E5" target="L8"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C6 validates quarantine mechanics</data></edge><edge id="E5_L9_validates" source="E5" target="L9"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C6 validates fracture mechanics</data></edge><edge id="E6_L18_validates" source="E6" target="L18"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C7 validates attention feedback (discovery improves prediction)</data></edge><edge id="E7_L20_validates" source="E7" target="L20"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">C8 validates free energy minimization for merge decisions</data></edge><edge id="E8_L11_validates" source="E8" target="L11"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Sleep validates synaptic pruning mechanics</data></edge><edge id="E9_L5_validates" source="E9" target="L5"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Demo validates attention warps cluster geometry</data></edge><edge id="E10_L19_validates" source="E10" target="L19"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI simulation validates the CPI measure</data></edge><edge id="E11_A12_validates" source="E11" target="A12"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Pipeline validates Stage 0 testing works</data></edge><edge id="E12_L15_validates" source="E12" target="L15"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Concept birth validates spectral clustering for emergence</data></edge><edge id="E13_L20_validates" source="E13" target="L20"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Replay sandbox validates free energy measurement</data></edge><edge id="M1_E10_validates" source="M1" target="E10"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI metric validated by live-fire simulation</data></edge><edge id="M14_A15_validates" source="M14" target="A15"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Edge confidence validates Bayesian edge evaluation</data></edge><edge id="S11_L1_validates" source="S11" target="L1"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Living graph validates Hebbian learning implementation</data></edge><edge id="S12_L18_validates" source="S12" target="L18"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Resonance phase validates resonance propagation</data></edge><edge id="S13_L1_validates" source="S13" target="L1"><data key="edgetype">validates</data><data key="edgedesc">Dream state validates Hebbian coactivation in subconscious linking</data></edge><edge id="K1_A11_falsifies" source="K1" target="A11"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI declining falsifies that system is learning</data></edge><edge id="K2_A3_falsifies" source="K2" target="A3"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Forgetting falsifies that stability solves it</data></edge><edge id="K4_A10_falsifies" source="K4" target="A10"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Nothing develops falsifies hand-authored scaffolding is acceptable</data></edge><edge id="K5_A12_falsifies" source="K5" target="A12"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Unresolved plateau falsifies probation testing works</data></edge><edge id="K6_L20_falsifies" source="K6" target="L20"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Sustained exhaustion falsifies system self-regulates</data></edge><edge id="K7_L9_falsifies" source="K7" target="L9"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Supersaturation falsifies fracture mechanics</data></edge><edge id="K8_A11_falsifies" source="K8" target="A11"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">No learning falsifies CPI captures genuine becoming</data></edge><edge id="K9_A7_falsifies" source="K9" target="A7"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">FEP misrepresentation falsifies the proxy claim</data></edge><edge id="K10_A12_falsifies" source="K10" target="A12"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Never confirming falsifies hypothesis testing pipeline</data></edge><edge id="E10_A11_falsifies" source="E10" target="A11"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">If CPI flatlines despite learning, the metric is falsified</data></edge><edge id="R1_L2_falsifies" source="R1" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Formal gap falsifies proxy being free energy</data></edge><edge id="R2_L3_falsifies" source="R2" target="L3"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Absence of hierarchy falsifies predictive coding claims</data></edge><edge id="R9_L2_falsifies" source="R9" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Only learning-rate modulation falsifies active inference claim</data></edge><edge id="R14_A10_falsifies" source="R14" target="A10"><data key="edgetype">falsifies</data><data key="edgedesc">Fixed curriculum falsifies claim of autonomous development</data></edge><edge id="L1_L3_derives_from" source="L1" target="L3"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Hebbian count updates are compatible with Dirichlet-Markov count model</data></edge><edge id="L2_L3_derives_from" source="L2" target="L3"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Energy proxy entropy H derives from Markov chain of clusters</data></edge><edge id="L2_L4_derives_from" source="L2" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Energy proxy surprise S derives from Shannon surprisal</data></edge><edge id="L2_L18_derives_from" source="L2" target="L18"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Energy proxy active load A influenced by resonance-based clustering</data></edge><edge id="L4_L3_derives_from" source="L4" target="L3"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Shannon surprise of symbol derives from Dirichlet-smoothed predictive distribution</data></edge><edge id="L5_L4_derives_from" source="L5" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Attention weight derives from probability that feeds into surprise</data></edge><edge id="L6_L4_derives_from" source="L6" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">KL divergence is expected value of log-ratio, related to surprise</data></edge><edge id="L7_L10_derives_from" source="L7" target="L10"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Inertia law derives from stability curve</data></edge><edge id="L9_L10_derives_from" source="L9" target="L10"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Fracture ratio compares to stability half-maturity constant</data></edge><edge id="L12_L6_derives_from" source="L12" target="L6"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Bayesian surprise is a specific KL divergence between Betas</data></edge><edge id="L13_L4_derives_from" source="L13" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">EIG = H(H)−Eₐ[H(H|A)] derives from Shannon entropy</data></edge><edge id="L14_L4_derives_from" source="L14" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">NPMI = log(p(x,y)/p(x)p(y)) / −log p(x,y) derives from pointwise mutual information</data></edge><edge id="L15_L14_derives_from" source="L15" target="L14"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Spectral clustering operates on NPMI-derived graph</data></edge><edge id="L17_L4_derives_from" source="L17" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Thermodynamic state from conflict state (surprise patterns)</data></edge><edge id="L19_M6_derives_from" source="L19" target="M6"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI accuracy component from prediction accuracy metric</data></edge><edge id="L19_M7_derives_from" source="L19" target="M7"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI decay component from surprise decay rate</data></edge><edge id="L19_M8_derives_from" source="L19" target="M8"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI compression component from compression ratio</data></edge><edge id="L19_M9_derives_from" source="L19" target="M9"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">CPI resolution component from contradictions resolved</data></edge><edge id="L20_L2_derives_from" source="L20" target="L2"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Free energy minimization derives from the proxy</data></edge><edge id="V1_L4_derives_from" source="V1" target="L4"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Surprise bits derives from Shannon surprisal</data></edge><edge id="V3_L6_derives_from" source="V3" target="L6"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Confidence delta derives from KL divergence</data></edge><edge id="V4_L10_derives_from" source="V4" target="L10"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Stability derives from stability curve formula</data></edge><edge id="V8_L7_derives_from" source="V8" target="L7"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Effective learning rate derives from Inertia Law</data></edge><edge id="V9_M2_derives_from" source="V9" target="M2"><data key="edgetype">derives_from</data><data key="edgedesc">Entropy H derives from transition entropy metric</data></edge><edge id